config BR2_PACKAGE_BLACKHAND_LORA
    bool "blackhand-lora"
    select BR2_PACKAGE_BLACKHAND_IPC
    help
      LoRa text messaging service. Drives an Adafruit RFM95W
      (Semtech SX1276) transceiver over /dev/spidev0.1 (SPI0 CE1)
      and exposes send/receive over /run/bh-lora.sock.

      Point-to-point broadcast text only (no addressing, ACK, or
      encryption in this MVP). Requires CONFIG_SPI_SPIDEV in the
      kernel and the RFM95 wired to SPI0 CE1 + RST on GPIO26.
